<!--
  A2 — End-Panel + Filler mini-catalogue.

  Promotes the "Finished Sides" attribute from a 4-value Selection
  (None/Left/Right/Both) into a real product catalogue. 18 records:

    5 panel styles × 3 cabinet classes = 15 end-panel SKUs
      Styles    : Standard / Inline / T&G / Radius / Square
      Classes   : Base (720×570) / Tall (1970×570) / Wall (720×330)
    3 fillers (Base / Tall / Wall) at 50mm width

  Dimensions reflect the Prodboard BetterKitchens catalogue inventory
  (CC- prefix is the Classic Collection convention there); Southbrook
  uses an SB- prefix and ships these as in-house panels.

  Pricing is intentionally NOT seeded — list_price=0 + x_pricing_pending=True
  until a per-style retail price is signed off (same convention as the
  Marathon-resold hardware in southbrook_hardware_seed.xml).
-->
